---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy | Phoenix World"
  description="What Phoenix World collects when you request an audit, who processes it, and how to reach us about it."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="chapter page" aria-labelledby="h-privacy">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="ch-head">
          <div class="ch-tag"><span class="num">LEGAL</span><span class="rule"></span><span class="name">Privacy</span></div>
          <h1 id="h-privacy" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.2vw,56px)">Privacy</h1>
          <p class="hud">Last updated 28 October 2026</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>This page explains what Phoenix World collects through phoenixworld.ai and what happens to it. Phoenix World is based in Miami, FL. Questions about any of this: <b><a href="mailto:hello@phoenixworld.ai">hello@phoenixworld.ai</a></b>.</p>

          <h2>What the audit form collects</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Your name, company and work email.</li>
            <li>The workflow you say hurts most.</li>
            <li>If you used them: the blueprint you picked and the numbers from the burn calculator (your inputs and the resulting estimate).</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We use this to reply to your request and to prepare and schedule your audit. Nothing else is collected through the form.</p>

          <h2>Who processes it</h2>
          <p>The form is run by Formspree, which receives your submission, stores it and forwards it to us by email. Formspree acts as our processor. See <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy" rel="noopener">Formspree's privacy policy</a>.</p>

          <h2>Analytics</h2>
          <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count visits and see which pages are read. It reports aggregate page views and does not use cookies. We do not use advertising trackers.</p>

          <h2>Hosting</h2>
          <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, which handles the technical data of each request (such as your IP address) to deliver the pages.</p>

          <h2>The "see your company reborn" box</h2>
          <p>The company name you type there is drawn on your own screen. It is not sent anywhere unless you also put it in the audit form.</p>

          <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
          <p>Audit requests sent through the website are kept for up to 12 months and then deleted, or sooner if you ask. Data shared during a client engagement is deleted within 30 days after the engagement ends.</p>

          <h2>Your choices</h2>
          <p>You can ask us to show you, correct or delete what we hold about you by emailing <b><a href="mailto:hello@phoenixworld.ai">hello@phoenixworld.ai</a></b>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
